      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As an update to the post, I've confirmed that Unity 2018 Terrain is also broken. \nBoth Gaia Eclipse (wrld_94e45943-3d03-401e-a974-d52d8d7648b7) (Last Updated 2020) and normal Gaia Night (wrld_ae476736-5dc0-4e2f-999a-1962360f93d3) (Last Updated May 2021) were last updated using Unity 2018 and have broken terrain on the 1261 beta. \nOnly Terrain uploaded with Unity 2019 is safe in this Beta. So any world with terrain uploaded before October 2021 (Vrchat's 2019 update) will be broken. \nI'm pretty sure Unity 2019 terrain is fine since Lost Valley Lake Retreat (wrld_3175143d-3c68-4719-9297-5f0145e059e2) was uploaded with Unity 2019 and it's terrain is fine on Beta.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
