      "value": "@{62cea1224517083b068f949b|full_name}: This has been fixed in the new Beta Build 1270 with the patch note line \"Fixed worlds having broken legacy shaders\"\n\nAll the worlds I posted are no longer pink and look as they should. \n\nThis can be marked as \"Bug Fixed\"",
