  "details": "Worlds that were uploaded with older unity versions have had their unity terrain turn completely pink. I suspect this happens on terrain from unity 2017 and older, but I haven't managed to confirm that 2018 terrain is broken yet. Terrain uploaded on 2019 seems fine. \nThis was first noticed in \nClassic Gaia Night (Last updated 2019): wrld_878aa9b3-bc6c-47f4-bd19-43d16dd85c50\nIt also happens in these other older worlds:\naurora mountain v12․7 (Last updated 2020): wrld_ffc94b9d-4fb6-4a4f-8307-cad787160f6a\nFlower Field (Last updated 2018): wrld_bd7ebe96-4bf6-4c3f-a4d7-977395fcbc14\nTwo of us (Last updated 2019): wrld_fd18c4e3-1280-42be-8121-aeca27cfa1f0\nThe Terrain (Last updated 2019): wrld_68b9e309-bf10-4f6a-a0fe-a470188152aa\nI've provided some screenshots showing how some of the worlds compare to live",
